How to interact with webelement
---------------------------------------

What is WebElement?
----------------------------
Every GUI element is Webelement(textbox,checkbox,link,button...etc)

Technically In Selenium We have WebElement is Interface

1.In Selenium Identify element
2.Perform action on those element

Selenium Identify Element using Locator

what is Locator?
------------------------
Locator is address of webelement from webpage

Selenium Support total 8 Locators
-----------------------------------------
1.By id
2.By name
3.By className
4.By linkText
5.By partialLinkText
6.By tagName

Dynamic WebElement automation
7.By cssSelector
8.By xpath

------------------------------------------------
Selenium version 4 they added Relative locators
-------------------------------------------------
leftOf()
rightOf()
above()
below()

