How to automate any HyperLink
----------------------------------

<a id="SignIn" href="login.html">Sign In</a>
                               <a>Link Text</a>

In selenium to automate any link we have two methods
1.linkText(): Full link text
----------------------------------
driver.findElement(By.linkText("Sign In")).click();

2.partialLinkText(): partial link Text
---------------------------------------------
driver.findElement(By.partialLinkText("In")).click();

